  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Recently a world was published with the ability to click a UI button that would open a browser to an external non-VRChat site. I would like to see if an update could be made to the SDK in the future to allow support for these types of UI as long as the user has enabled to allow untrusted links. This could dynamically change the ability how users are able to create in the platform and share.  This should be easy to do since it was already completed on someone else's SDK.",
